From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:59:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vm: avoid WeakShape upgrades in inline caches and descriptor
 builds in ordinary_get

Store the cached shape address alongside its WeakShape in CacheEntry so
InlineCache::get_slot can use a shared borrow and check address equality
plus weak liveness without upgrading a Gc handle or cloning a Shape on
every property read or write.

Also fast-path GetPropertyByName and SetPropertyByName for object
receivers without extra register clones, and walk ordinary prototype
chains iteratively in ordinary_get using direct slot reads instead of
constructing temporary PropertyDescriptor values.
